### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA

### Create Course
POST http://localhost:8080/api1/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "class_id": "0195c9aa-b773-77a0-bed1-6e2c7eaf8079",
  "title": "Math",
  "description": "Mathematics",
  "difficulty_level": "medium",
  "number" : 1
}

### Get Courses by Class ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api1/courses/0195c9aa-b773-77a0-bed1-6e2c7eaf8079

### Update Course
PUT http://localhost:8080/api1/courses/0195c9aa-b773-77a0-bed1-6e2c7eaf8079
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Mathematics",
  "description": "Mathematics",
  "difficulty_level": "medium",
  "number" : 1
}

